          "passageId": "ws16e-p4",
          "text": {
            "en": "Cao Cao sent Xiahou Yuan to assist the commandery in attacking Liang Xing's remnants at Fucheng.",
            "zht": "曹操派夏侯淵協助郡府攻打駐鄜城的梁興殘部。",
            "zhs": "曹操派夏侯渊协助郡府攻打驻鄜城的梁兴残部。"
          }
        }
