      "directed": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "passageId": "ws16e-p4",
          "text": {
            "en": "When the bandit Jin Fu abducted the Xiayang and Shaoling county officials into Mount Wei, Zheng Hun attacked, defeated him, and rescued the officials.",
            "zht": "盜賊靳富劫持夏陽、邵陵二縣長吏及百姓入山，鄭渾出兵擊敗他，救出被劫官員。",
            "zhs": "盗贼靳富劫持夏阳、邵陵二县长吏及百姓入山，郑浑出兵击败他，救出被劫官员。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
